  "rationale": "JAVA-SYMBOL-AMBIGUITY-HINT-1 INPUT-3 accepted at document cycle 12 (relay iteration 10) with no finding: the amendment after implementation admission 2 (which passed JSAH-C01-C03 and returned DECISION_REQUIRED on an incomplete payload) - D-JSAH-INCOMPLETE-CURSOR-1 A with Corrections 1-2 (a candidate whose command cannot be formed keeps its row, gets no cursor line, and the hint names each tested condition; the renderer chooses the reason from data.query; line_start 0 is read as null and presentation::anchor never prints :0; u64::try_from nulls negatives only) and D-JSAH-PLACEMENT-1 Correction 2 (the renderer takes cursor: Option<(prefix, suffix)>; path_cursor_affixes returns Option - the unknown-side state is a type, never an empty-string sentinel); JSAH-C01 runs the daemon-crate consolidation witness; sixteen new tests. The eight pinned decisions are operator decisions under the human's standing authority, overridable. Cycles 9-11 of this item were operator-text corrections (one relaunch wasted on a cap error); cycle 12 accepted."
